# A sole actual of class (b), a built-in operator expression, at a long formal: today's admission fills no long
# formal with any value, so the pair is refused before the evaluation; tick never runs (fable 2026-11-22).
# The pin rests on today's admission (fable Р129), not on the norm: by the norm the answer depends on the
# conversion table of the satisfies library; it is derived anew at step 21.8 (a).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: r 0
)
fn: tick () int
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := shared\Observed\seen + 1
    return: 3
fn: f (long: a) int
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\r := 2
    return: 2
sub: main ()
    f(1 + tick())
main()
